 {
+    // HID state is polled rather than delivered as a native window event.
+    // Keep it responsive while letting Minecraft's frame limiter sleep.
+    // A posted event remains signalled until consumed, including one posted
+    // immediately before this wait. UEvent needs no privileged kernel event.
